# Krang & Shredder: "Whenever Krang & Shredder enter or attack, each opponent exiles cards from the top of their library until they exile a nonland card." Bot1 pays {4}{U/B}{U/B} with Black Lotus'
# BBB (sacrificed, so a permanent left), Mox Jet, Mox Sapphire and Mox Pearl. Bot2's two top Islands and then Grizzly Bears are exiled with it. "Disappear - ... you may cast a card exiled with
# Krang & Shredder without paying its mana cost": at the end step a land among them is no choice (it cannot be cast), the Bears is, and it enters under Bot1's control.

